+# Contributing
+
+Thanks for improving this awesome list.
+
+## Submission Requirements
+
+Every submission must include:
+
+- A public `github.com` repository URL
+- A clear open-source license visible on GitHub
+- A short explanation of why the repo belongs in an AI agents list
+- The primary language
+- The most appropriate category
+
+Submissions will be rejected if they are:
+
+- Proprietary SaaS tools without a public GitHub repository
+- Dead repos with no clear AI-agent relevance
+- Blog posts, landing pages, YouTube videos, or product sites without source code
+- Duplicate entries
+
+## Preferred Format
+
+Use this structure when proposing a new entry:
+
+```md
+#### [Tool Name](https://github.com/username/repo)
+> **Description:** Short summary of what the project does, why it matters, and its license.
+
