+- **Stars:** 1234 ⭐
+- **Language:** Python
+- **License:** MIT
+- **Last Commit:** Jan 1, 2026
+- **Category:** framework, self-hosted
+- **Best for:** Brief use case
+```
+
+## Quality Bar
+
+Please keep the list useful:
+
+- Prefer maintained repositories
+- Prefer repos with real documentation and clear positioning
+- Keep descriptions factual and specific
+- Do not submit tools unless the source code is actually on GitHub
+
+## Pull Requests
+
+- Keep PRs focused
+- One category cleanup or a small batch of related additions is preferred
+- If stars, licenses, or activity changed, mention the refresh date in the PR
+
+## Reporting Issues
+
