+
+> This curated list of the best open source AI agents 2026 highlights serious GitHub projects for building, running, and self-hosting agent systems. It focuses on public repositories only, excludes proprietary SaaS-only products, and surfaces practical tools for agent frameworks, coding agents, browser agents, local assistants, and workflow automation.
